  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "mobius_transformation",
    "template": "$w = \\frac{z - i}{z + i}$，分析实虚部、模与积分",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1) 证明 $w$ 为实数",
      "steps": [
        "当 $x = 0, y > 0$ 时，$z = iy$",
        "$w = \\frac{iy - i}{iy + i} = \\frac{i(y-1)}{i(y+1)} = \\frac{y-1}{y+1}$",
        "因为 $y > 0$，$\\frac{y-1}{y+1}$ 是实数，所以 $w$ 是实数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2) 当 $y = 0$ 时求 $|w|$",
      "steps": [
        "当 $y = 0$ 时，$z = x$",
        "$w = \\frac{x - i}{x + i}$",
        "$|w| = \\left|\\frac{x - i}{x + i}\\right| = \\frac{|x - i|}{|x + i|} = \\frac{\\sqrt{x^2 + 1}}{\\sqrt{x^2 + 1}} = 1$",
        "所以 $|w| = 1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(3) 求 $|w| < 1$ 的条件",
      "steps": [
        "对于一般的 $z = x + iy$，$w = \\frac{z - i}{z + i} = \\frac{(x + i(y-1))}{(x + i(y+1))}$",
        "$|w|^2 = \\frac{x^2 + (y-1)^2}{x^2 + (y+1)^2}$",
        "$|w| < 1 \\Leftrightarrow x^2 + (y-1)^2 < x^2 + (y+1)^2$",
        "$\\Leftrightarrow (y-1)^2 < (y+1)^2$",
        "$\\Leftrightarrow y^2 - 2y + 1 < y^2 + 2y + 1$",
        "$\\Leftrightarrow -2y < 2y$",
        "$\\Leftrightarrow -4y < 0$",
        "$\\Leftrightarrow y > 0$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(4) 计算积分",
      "steps": [
        "$f(z) = \\frac{z - i}{z + i}$ 的奇点为 $z = -i$",
        "$-i$ 的模为 $|-i| = 1$",
        "对于 $C_{0.5}$：圆的半径为 $0.5 < 1$，奇点 $z = -i$ 不在 $C_{0.5}$ 内，由Cauchy定理",
        "$\\int_{C_{0.5}} f(z)dz = 0$",
        "对于 $C_{1.5}$：圆的半径为 $1.5 > 1$，奇点 $z = -i$ 在 $C_{1.5}$ 内",
        "$f(z) = \\frac{z - i}{z + i} = 1 - \\frac{2i}{z + i}$",
        "在 $z = -i$ 处的留数为 $\\text{Res}(f, -i) = \\lim_{z \\to -i}(z+i) \\cdot (-\\frac{2i}{z+i}) = -2i$",
        "由留数定理，$\\int_{C_{1.5}} f(z)dz = 2\\pi i \\cdot (-2i) = -4\\pi i^2 = 4\\pi$"
      ]
    }
  ],
